<title>JAPAN: Toyama Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyama Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.45		vs	   19.50</p>
<p> Operating	    1.46		vs	    1.71</p>
<p> Current		1.34		vs	    1.44</p>
<p> Net		  592    million	  vs	  494    million</p>
