<p> Shares	    150 million	  vs	 150 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyama Chemical Co Ltd is a pharmaceutical manufacturer focusing on antibiotics.</p>
